    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skeleton Arena is a roguelite dungeon crawler where you battle through waves of undead in procedurally generated arenas. Choose a new warrior after every death and fight to keep the cursed portal from overwhelming your fort.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Tactical Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is fast, reactive, and rewards timing and positioning.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use light and heavy attacks to create custom combos and break enemy defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge to avoid damage, close distance, or reposition mid-fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip active and passive abilities to suit your playstyle \u2014 from explosive strikes to defensive buffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon feels distinct, with its own moveset and rhythm.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724010/extras/3e89c0601abaaaf008dc68675d088808.poster.avif?t=1755094012\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724010/extras/3e89c0601abaaaf008dc68675d088808.webm?t=1755094012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724010/extras/3e89c0601abaaaf008dc68675d088808.mp4?t=1755094012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Death Is Just the Beginning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you fall, a new warrior rises. Play as random soldiers, volunteers, or mysterious characters from the fortress. Each has their own gear and quirks \u2014 adapt or perish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724010/extras/a70b6ed4fc54d8c511f217f0cc44ee40.poster.avif?t=1755094012\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724010/extras/a70b6ed4fc54d8c511f217f0cc44ee40.webm?t=1755094012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724010/extras/a70b6ed4fc54d8c511f217f0cc44ee40.mp4?t=1755094012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Shifting Dungeon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run leads into a procedurally generated dungeon where no path is the same twice.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rooms and corridors are randomized at the start of each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biomes include natural overgrowth, abandoned training halls, and cursed strongholds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional paths and hidden secrets reward exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724010/extras/aaebbd8a6d8834b2acb92ce30f4f93e3.poster.avif?t=1755094012\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724010/extras/aaebbd8a6d8834b2acb92ce30f4f93e3.webm?t=1755094012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724010/extras/aaebbd8a6d8834b2acb92ce30f4f93e3.mp4?t=1755094012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fortress Hub Between Runs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between dungeon attempts, return to the fortress \u2014 a last bastion of humanity.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your weapons at the blacksmith</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase items, scrolls, and trinkets from Ricardo, a mysterious merchant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to NPCs who offer quests, stories, or hints about the dungeon</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724010/extras/d8f1407c081e3116820f97df74dc6983.poster.avif?t=1755094012\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724010/extras/d8f1407c081e3116820f97df74dc6983.webm?t=1755094012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724010/extras/d8f1407c081e3116820f97df74dc6983.mp4?t=1755094012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision-based third-person combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite structure with permanent death and randomization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of enemy types with distinct attack patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random characters with varied gear, stats, and playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivor camps every few floors with merchants and NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fortress hub where the world slowly unravels through dialogue and upgrades</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skeleton Arena is a roguelite dungeon crawler where you battle through waves of undead in procedurally generated arenas. Choose a new warrior after every death and fight to keep the cursed portal from overwhelming your fort.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Tactical Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is fast, reactive, and rewards timing and positioning.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use light and heavy attacks to create custom combos and break enemy defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge to avoid damage, close distance, or reposition mid-fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip active and passive abilities to suit your playstyle \u2014 from explosive strikes to defensive buffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon feels distinct, with its own moveset and rhythm.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724010/extras/3e89c0601abaaaf008dc68675d088808.poster.avif?t=1755094012\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724010/extras/3e89c0601abaaaf008dc68675d088808.webm?t=1755094012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724010/extras/3e89c0601abaaaf008dc68675d088808.mp4?t=1755094012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Death Is Just the Beginning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you fall, a new warrior rises. Play as random soldiers, volunteers, or mysterious characters from the fortress. Each has their own gear and quirks \u2014 adapt or perish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.