inkets from Ricardo, a mysterious merchant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to NPCs who offer quests, stories, or hints about the dungeon</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724010/extras/d8f1407c081e3116820f97df74dc6983.poster.avif?t=1755094012\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724010/extras/d8f1407c081e3116820f97df74dc6983.webm?t=1755094012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724010/extras/d8f1407c081e3116820f97df74dc6983.mp4?t=1755094012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision-based third-person combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite structure with permanent death and randomization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of enemy types with distinct attack patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random characters with varied gear, stats, and playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivor camps every few floors with merchants and NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fortress hub where the world slowly unravels through dialogue and upgrades</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
